From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] bluetooth and usb read-only queries (3557)

bluetoothapis, windows.devices.bluetooth, windows.devices.usb: read-only queries

bluetoothapis: BluetoothGetRadioInfo (IOCTL_BTH_GET_LOCAL_INFO: address, name, class, manufacturer),
BluetoothIsConnectable / IsDiscoverable (one radio or any), BluetoothGetDeviceInfo (parameter checks,
unknown device), BluetoothFindFirstDevice/NextDevice/DeviceClose (parameter checks; no device is found,
ERROR_NO_MORE_ITEMS, the same answer with or without a radio).
windows.devices.bluetooth: BluetoothAdapter objects for the present radio interfaces, GetDefaultAsync
and FromIdAsync as completed operations (null when there is no radio or no such id), factory
inspectable methods.
windows.devices.usb: GetDeviceSelector, GetDeviceSelectorGuidOnly, GetDeviceClassSelector, FromIdAsync
(null device), factory inspectable methods.
